<p>You mount a grenade launcher on your steamgun that launches high explosive rounds. Each time you make a basic attack with your steamgun or a heavy weapon, you fire a grenade at the target that explodes for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">104%, 123%, 137%, 149%, 160%</acronym> steamgun damage in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 2, 2.</acronym></p><p>This talent also reinforces the armor of you and your minions to give you immunity to your own grenades.</p><p>You can only fire a single grenade once every 9 turns.</p>